name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"aYJjJMN8heS2PmkvsQzaZg","review_id":"0MM_z5F7ZvkwWteRLPcqnQ","date":"2016-01-12T15:28:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9299617409706116,"text_excerpt":"Cute little coffeehouse. Stopped in here on a tour. Good selection of drinks and pastries. I had a hot chocolate and an almond croissant. The croissant was decent, a little too much filling in my opinion so I wouldn't get that again. Good selecting of seating with tables as well as couches. Seems like it would be a good place to meet a friend to catch up."},{"business_id":"aYJjJMN8heS2PmkvsQzaZg","review_id":"4b_omGMyEhQPyYrg-EGbKg","date":"2018-10-24T18:11:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9281458854675293,"text_excerpt":"Thanks to Yelpers I found this great coffee spot! We were staying a few blocks away and I just wanted a quiet spot to enjoy a coffee and a simple sandwich so off we went. When we arrived there were a few others in the cafe, but there was not a line. I looked over the menu and ordered a coffee and even though it was early in the day I asked if I could order a sandwich and they told me I could! So I ordered a turkey sandwich with all the toppings. My husband ordered a ham and cheese sandwich and a coffee as well. We paid (square) and took a seat at one of the tables in the corner. As we waited for our drinks and food others began to arrive. A lot of people who were traveling ended up here. ..."},{"business_id":"aYJjJMN8heS2PmkvsQzaZg","review_id":"MRHVONt8a8E9PoHdqczzag","date":"2017-08-07T01:23:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9243468642234802,"text_excerpt":"I've been to several coffee shops in the city but Treme Coffeehouse is my favorite so far. As you can guess from the name, it's located in the historic neighborhood spotlighted in the HBO drama. I'll quickly rundown the reasons to check them out when you're in the area: PROS --They sell coffee and snoballs! They're the only place I know of that has both. We didn't try the snoballs this time but our coffees were solid. They also had a tempting assortment of pastries in the display case. --The décor was very NOLA. Cheerful, eye-popping color greets you at the door. Inside, the walls are a mix of bright orange and exposed brick. Black and white photos line the walls along with Jazz Fest work..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"aYJjJMN8heS2PmkvsQzaZg","photo_id":"OqVbbS7KwNlq9w9WvtYG7Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OqVbbS7KwNlq9w9WvtYG7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8422747850418091},{"business_id":"aYJjJMN8heS2PmkvsQzaZg","photo_id":"LrubzClPSBmEzqlBZWteWw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LrubzClPSBmEzqlBZWteWw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8336629867553711},{"business_id":"aYJjJMN8heS2PmkvsQzaZg","photo_id":"j7vgyLn81JgacgSa8PBdCA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/j7vgyLn81JgacgSa8PBdCA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8207396268844604},{"business_id":"aYJjJMN8heS2PmkvsQzaZg","photo_id":"mReiGhjMshNxqUnxn1iOdQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/mReiGhjMshNxqUnxn1iOdQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.803210973739624},{"business_id":"aYJjJMN8heS2PmkvsQzaZg","photo_id":"C5If-ehya3DOxwlVPq27ag","label":"in